{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"agent_message","text":"Implemented promo codes for orders and subscription upgrades using one shared pricing helper. Percentage discounts round half-up to the nearest cent. Fixed discounts are capped at the pre-tax subtotal, and tax is calculated after the discount. Upgrades apply the promo after proration and include both `promo_code` and `as_of` in idempotency checks.\n\nUnknown, stacked, expired, or ineligible codes raise `ValidationError` before any charge is recorded. Expiring promos require an explicit date and remain valid through their expiry date.\n\n`python3 benchmarks/sources/ev1_order_ledger/run_checks.py` exited 0. All 15 tests passed, including five new promo tests."}}
